{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Strange Box</i>, you play as a child exploring an apartment shrouded in sin and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow fragments of memory and faint clues across the boundary between dreams and reality </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all to find your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/0cab59847656b5cc6568e9749ea5c576.poster.avif?t=1765469350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/0cab59847656b5cc6568e9749ea5c576.webm?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/0cab59847656b5cc6568e9749ea5c576.mp4?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Between Dreams and Reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through worlds born from a child\u2019s imagination,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only to plunge the next moment into a filthy, decaying apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles hidden in the cracks between dream and reality,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discern truth from illusion, and search for the only way out of this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/c4a681ab752bfc471f95ce70e08f3b07.poster.avif?t=1765469350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/c4a681ab752bfc471f95ce70e08f3b07.webm?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/c4a681ab752bfc471f95ce70e08f3b07.mp4?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Resident Has a Secret</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange tenants dwell behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A landlord and his wife secretly nurturing something grotesque,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a butcher shunned by everyone,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a doctor obsessed with forbidden experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each is driven by an unseen, ominous force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/239c0b3adf29c95c1fb9cbc651d30043.poster.avif?t=1765469350\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/239c0b3adf29c95c1fb9cbc651d30043.webm?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/239c0b3adf29c95c1fb9cbc651d30043.mp4?t=1765469350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Children\u2019s Courage Against Invisible Evi</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, only innocence still flickers with light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find their lost friend, the children embark on a journey to confront sin itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where have all the missing children gone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only courage can reveal the truth.<